{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08989","headline":"高陵书情寄三原卢少府 · 韦应物","name":"高陵书情寄三原卢少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直方难爲进，守此微贱班。\n开卷不及顾，沈埋案牍间。\n兵凶久相践，徭赋岂得闲。\n促戚下可哀，宽政身致患。\n日夕思自退，出门望故山。\n君心傥如此，携手相与还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}